## The eight CZD packages. They are not on any mirror; build.sh drops the freshly built
## .debs into packages.chroot/ and live-build installs them from there. Listing them here
## makes the dependency set explicit and makes a missing .deb a build failure, not a silent gap.
czd-purple-tokens
czd-plasma-theme
czd-icon-theme
czd-boot-theme
czd-sddm-theme
czd-terminal-profiles
czd-wallpapers
czd-welcome
